        <section ids="installing" names="installing">
            <title>Installing</title>
            <paragraph>urllib3 can be installed with <reference name="pip" refuri="https://pip.pypa.io">pip</reference><target ids="pip" names="pip" refuri="https://pip.pypa.io"></target></paragraph>
            <literal_block force="0" highlight_args="{}" language="bash" linenos="0" xml:space="preserve">$ python -m pip install urllib3</literal_block>
            <paragraph>Alternatively, you can grab the latest source code from <reference name="GitHub" refuri="https://github.com/urllib3/urllib3">GitHub</reference><target ids="github" names="github" refuri="https://github.com/urllib3/urllib3"></target>:</paragraph>
            <literal_block force="0" highlight_args="{}" language="bash" linenos="0" xml:space="preserve">$ git clone https://github.com/urllib3/urllib3.git
$ cd urllib3
$ pip install .</literal_block>
        </section>
